      "question": "What is the 2 hour rule for arthritis?",
      "type": "featured_snippet",
      "snippet": "The 2 Hour Pain Rule An increase in pain after activity that lasts more than 2 hours suggests that you need to alter your exercise regime. If you find that there is an increase in symptoms with exercise, you may need to reduce the frequency, intensity, time duration or type of exercise involving the affected joints.",
